  "notes": "{差|さ}し{上|あ}げる is the humble form of ⟦あげる→あげる：00546_ageru⟧ (to give).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nKEIGO FORMS OF ⟦あげる→あげる：00546_ageru⟧:\n- ⟦あげる→あげる：00546_ageru⟧: plain (giving to equals/inferiors)\n- {差|さ}し{上|あ}げる: humble (giving to superiors)\n- ⟦くださる→くださる：01305_kudasaru⟧: honorific (superior giving to you)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{差|さ}し{上|あ}げる: to give X (to someone respected)\n- ⟦お→お〜：03097_o⟧〜{差|さ}し{上|あ}げる: to do ~ for someone (humble)\n\nNote: In modern usage, {差|さ}し{上|あ}げる can sound overly formal or servile in some contexts. Use appropriately based on the situation.",
